# ===== .gitignore (v2) =====
# Policy: accept EVERYTHING except bitforge build outputs and OS junk.
# Vivado project_1, .runs, .sim, .Xil, .dcp, .bit, .rpt, iverilog .vvp/.vcd are all tracked.

# --- bitforge artifacts (do not track) ---
**/*bitforge*/
**/*bitforge*
# --- OS junk ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
